  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf2d7532251303545ab78ab68b00d5cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  sequenceId: Lobby_ElevatorRide
  notes: 'Elevator briefing before arrival on floor 17. Source: HEARTH_Full_Game_Script_No_Audio_Tags_Native_English.md,
    stable marker Lobby_ElevatorRide. Text is synchronized by Tools/Hearth/Dialogue/Sync
    All Dialogue From Final Script.'
  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, before we reach seventeen, I'll give you a brief overview. Procedure
      first, then I'll guide you into the route.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Go ahead.
    holdSeconds: 2.2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Every inspection has three steps. First, read the household file at the
      corridor terminal.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Second, enter the household unit's point of view and replay the event under
      review.
    holdSeconds: 6.4330187
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Third, select a disposition. Your decision changes how the unit is used
      and may affect the Household Emotional Stability Index.
    holdSeconds: 8.697169
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: And you'll tell me which disposition you prefer.
    holdSeconds: 4.1688676
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: "Of course. Every recommendation comes from the inspection manual\u2014the
      company's standard answer."
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: Understood. I'll still make my own call.
    holdSeconds: 3.7915094
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
